# 最小化着退出也存盘（第二阶段 112400c，Mac）：先恢复图形与时钟再请存盘；修之前存盘总是超时
# Quitting while minimized still saves (phase 2, 112400c, Mac): graphics and the clock are resumed before the save is requested; before the fix the save always timed out
name quit_while_minimized_saves
requires cli
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
stick 0 1 frames=30
app minimize
sleep 1
system_quit
check saved
check exit 0
check event quit_save saved=true
